.TH ZDOTS-PLATFORM 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-platform \- Verbs:
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-platform --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: zdots-platform <verb> [args]

Verbs:
  status          branch · ahead/behind origin/main · dirty count, per repo
  fetch           git fetch origin on all four repos
  verify          compare local work tip vs remote origin/work, per repo
  push            print the push commands for repos with unpushed work
  push --run      execute the pushes (refused inside Claude Code — the
                  principal pushes; cc-hook-guard is the enforced boundary)
  exec <git args> run a git command across all four repos (e.g. exec log -1)
  -h, --help      this help

Repos: zdots(~/.config/zsh)  my(~/my)  vdots(~/.config/nvim)  adots(bare ~/.homegit)
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
